OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water is to implement
OL,7,Ffurther hosepipe restrictions for its
OL,8,Fcustomers across Sussex.
OL,10,FFrom 8 October, in order to "protect
OL,11,Fwater supplies and the environment", it
OL,12,Fis removing some previous exemptions to
OL,13,Fthe temporary ban that came into place
OL,14,Fin July including vulnerable people on
OL,15,Fthe company's register, although an
OL,16,Fexemption remains in cases of health
OL,17,Fand safety reasons and animal welfare.
OL,19,FHead of water resources Nick Price told
OL,20,FBBC Radio Sussex the "fairly unusual"
OL,21,Fstep was due to lower rainfall than
OL,22,Fexpected.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
