OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has also applied to the
OL,7,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,8,FRural Affairs to extend the ban on all
OL,9,Fnon-essential commercial water usage.
